  {"name": "The Palace lot", "x0": 162.0, "x1": 192.0, "teaches": "sun break mid-lot (rain, 6 m sun, rain): close it in the sun to recover, reopen in time"},
  {"name": "Pawn Row", "x0": 220.0, "x1": 257.0, "teaches": "final exam: torn awnings keep the umbrella up (stamina), a gutter through the toy shop's torn awning, a breather under SECOND HAND, a last gutter at the inn"}
